2026-07-27T08:20:48.6187366Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T08:20:48.6187824Z i /tmp/RtmpqQet7K/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:20:48.6188125Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:20:48.6188489Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:20:48.6189070Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:20:48.6189567Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:20:48.6190245Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:20:48.6190802Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T08:20:48.6478543Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:20:48.6591796Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:20:48.7099950Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:20:48.7304468Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
